ll the proportions  right and keeping it very simple this is  not the time to be wearing pinstripes  this is not the time to be wearing a  plaid and this is not the time to be  shrinking behind that dark suit another  thing that we did for Dylan is we gave  him a really cool haircut I don't  he's had his hair cut this well in years  and actually upgraded his glasses to  something that was a little bit more  contemporary and definitely a softer  color more of a tortoise Brown rather  than the black pair that he was wearing  which went a lot better with his skin  tone so all in all I think Dylan is  ready for the stage
 

